<section class="section about" id="About">
  <div class="education-card reveal reveal--left">
    <div class="container about__grid">
      {% img "assets/images/experience/aquilo/sebastian-hudak-aquilo-team.jpeg", "Sebastian Hudak with the AQUILO student rocket team", "about__image" %}

      <div class="about__content">
        <h2 class="about_title"> I'm Sebastián Hudák.</h2>
        <p class="about__text">
          Desire and passion for new challenges are my main drives. I like to push boundaries of my own capabilities
 each day and make sure that what I do, I do on 100%.
 From research, design, manufacturing, to testing and validation, I enjoy the whole product development cycle.
 I love multidisciplinary projects with a high level of complexity that require creative solutions. My
 workstyle is based on a systematic, logical approach and collaboration with others to bring the future into reality.
        </p>

        <div class="education-card">
          {% img "assets/images/page/sebastian-hudak-signature.png", "Sebastian Hudak signature", "about__signature" %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

